From 1755993845c1dd7fe2be95c057d768c499be4bff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maxime <maxime.lefrancois@emse.fr>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:20:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Support rml:languageMap (RML-Core)

A term map's rml:languageMap, the term map that generates the language tag
of a literal in RML-Core, was ignored: the literal had no language tag.
The RML-Core test cases RMLTC0031a-c (kg-construct/rml-core) use it.

termMapToExpr now translates the language map into an expression and wraps
the value in STRLANG, for references and templates, as it does for
rml:language.
---
